  "title": "Veggie Lasagna",
  "description": "Lasagna noodles are layered with a rich combination of cheeses and mixed vegetables, such as broccoli, carrots and corn, but no tomato sauce! Use any of your favorite vegetables.",
  "authors": [
    "Christine Tolisano"
  ],
